      "question": "Lesion",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-5abd371f31",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-5abd371f31",
          "answer": "Unilateral injury causes hoarseness from ipsilateral vocal-fold paralysis; bilateral injury can cause severe airway obstruction because both vocal folds may remain near the midline.",
